# Each pattern is for a file that turns up in this tree.

### Built here
/target/
/dist/
node_modules/
/src-tauri/gen/schemas/
__pycache__/

### Written by a run, about one machine
engine-probe.json
*.log
*.iso
lyonoyl-vm-*/

### Left by the system or an editor
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
[Dd]esktop.ini
.directory
*~

### One developer's tools
# CLAUDE.md, a one-line pointer, is the one vendor file kept.
.vscode/
.idea/
.zed/
.claude/
CLAUDE.local.md
.cursor/
.cursorrules
.windsurf/
.windsurfrules
.gemini/
GEMINI.md
.junie/
.aider*

### GitHub
# No workflows: the checks run locally. Ignored so a tool cannot add one unasked.
.github/

### Anything that identifies anybody
# Certificates, keys and provisioning. The boundary gate refuses them when tracked, too.
*.p8
*.certSigningRequest
*.p12
*.pfx
*.cer
*.crt
*.der
*.pem
*.key
*.mobileprovision
*.provisionprofile
*.keychain
*.keychain-db

# Environment files, the signing one among them.
*.env
.env.*

# Local Cargo configuration: a signing runner names its identity.
.cargo/
